        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "Amazing is Ayodhya for its lay-out is like a game board called aSTapadi, and with its flocks of beautiful women moving thereabout, where all kinds of precious gems are heaped up, and where its seven storied buildings are picturesque. [1-5-16]"
      }
    ],
